      ],
      "notes": "PIN_NEOPIXEL — onboard single status NeoPixel (WS2812), output-only data line. Power is separately gated by GPIO11 (NEOPIXEL_POWER, must be driven HIGH by sketch code — not exposed as a pin, see pins_arduino.h). Confirmed via Adafruit's own pinouts guide, CircuitPython's pins.c (NEOPIXEL -> pin_GPIO12), and Zephyr's adafruit_qt_py_rp2040.dts onboard ws2812 node (gpio0 pin 12)."
